      "final_text": "表现最佳的社会责任投资(SRI)行业之一是国防领域。美国国防采购历来倾向于现有的纯国防承包商，而非来自商业领域的新进入者，但国会和国防部(DoD)正致力于寻求更好的平衡，类似于20世纪80年代所存在的格局。主承包商较高的订单出货比(book-to-bill)表明，其供应链所受的制约程度高于霍尼韦尔(Honeywell)、卡特彼勒(Caterpillar)等商业领域承包商。",
      "iterations": 0,
      "seg_status": "machine",
      "source_text": "One of the best SRI industries has been defense.  US defense acquisition typically favors incumbent pure-play defense contractors over new entrants from the commercial sector, but Congress and the DoD are working to strike more of a balance, like the one that existed in the 1980s. High book-to-bill ratios for prime contractors show more supply chain constraints than commercial sector contractors such as Honeywell/Caterpillar.",
